{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rip out the floor, rotate it and place it somewhere else!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/extras/1.gif?t=1742419719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sokowand </i>is a top-down retro puzzle game that fuses classic sokoban-inspired puzzles with a magical floor that can be ripped out. Need to cross a gap? Use the floor next to you. Need a button for a door? Steal it from the last room! But don't be too quick, some floors are more important than they seem to appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/extras/2.gif?t=1742419719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reassemble each of the 40+ rooms and build your way block by block - or rather floor by floor - to the goal. Push boxes to open doors, manipulate signals, redirect laser by rotating mirrors and rewire entire floors full of electricity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/extras/3.gif?t=1742419719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sokowand</i> contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique twist on a classic puzzle genre</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">45 Levels with an ever growing complexity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nostalgia inspired artstyle and soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hints for a more laid back experience </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/extras/4New.gif?t=1742419719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580100?t=1742419719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/2937d702a5a06bbe64473b7179e48f8d0cfa9eff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742419719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/89490f6d0c7d40cd0fe8d37a0833a7b08f1f40e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742419719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/89490f6d0c7d40cd0fe8d37a0833a7b08f1f40e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742419719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rip out the floor, rotate it and place it somewhere else!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/extras/1.gif?t=1742419719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sokowand </i>is a top-down retro puzzle game that fuses classic sokoban-inspired puzzles with a magical floor that can be ripped out. Need to cross a gap? Use the floor next to you. Need a button for a door? Steal it from the last room! But don't be too quick, some floors are more important than they seem to appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/extras/2.gif?t=1742419719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reassemble each of the 40+ rooms and build your way block by block - or rather floor by floor - to the goal. Push boxes to open doors, manipulate signals, redirect laser by rotating mirrors and rewire entire floors full of electricity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/extras/3.gif?t=1742419719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sokowand</i> contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique twist on a classic puzzle genre</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">45 Levels with an ever growing complexity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nostalgia inspired artstyle and soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hints for a more laid back experience </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/extras/4New.gif?t=1742419719\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["TheHolyFurry"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580100/2bb6ecb1eb4ed59ea4a505a0936fbb0b4c86737d/header.jpg?t=1742419719","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111390,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111390/movie480.mp4?t=1741690560","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111390/movie_max.mp4?t=1741690560"},"name":"Sokowand Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111390/9fa2f4004ea2c7fedca2aa1837bed7e5b3fc7285/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741690560","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111390/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741690560","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111390/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741690560"}}],"name":"Sokowand","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimu